void-music-player (vmp) is just a simple TUI keyboard-driven music player


## Installation

# Requirements:
Nerd Font set as default in your terminal of choice,
Go (for compiling)

# Installing vmp:
git clone https://github.com/vmp102/void-music-player.git
cd void-music-player
go build .

After these, running void-music-player in your terminal should start running vmp
